    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'The CNPq Representations: Imaginary and Technology Research Group - RITe
    brings together researchers from various areas of knowledge - from philosophy
    to information science, from geography to archeology - dedicated to the scientific
    investigation of themes pertinent to the field of architecture and urbanism that
    interact with representations and with processes of production of objects, buildings
    and urban spaces. There are 3 linked study groups: The Technology Imaginary Study
    Group - GEIST; o Future Urban Scenarios - CUF and Experimental Daydreams and
    Imaginative Poetics - DEPi.'
