--- !u!114 &1842802210
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1842802208}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 255, g: 255, b: 255, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: b2c60a74286ee0f479d79b3976431f8d, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 64
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 0
    m_MaxSize: 64
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Tired of tendonitis when scrolling your fingers through feeds and stories
    in search of incredible news about the lives of others you know and/or admire
    so much? Tired of the obstacles that concrete reality imposes on you, hindering
    your experience in the digital world? So get your favorite virtual reality stereoscopic
    display ready, because <i><color=#000>The Instagram City</color></i> is here!
    It's time to realize your Instagram citizenship and dive into a world of updated
    images on the air in continuous rotation.\n\nThe hyperdimensional interface of
    <i><color=#000>The Instagram City</color></i> allows for an unprecedented immersive
    experience. The experience of your feeds and stories will be materialized through
    a living and continuous urbanizing architecture, which unfolds into a built and
    uplifting outdoor landscape. So, get up from your bed or sofa now, go for a long
    immersive walk without leaving your seat, and feel like a full citizen in <i><color=#000>The
    Instagram City</color></i> ! After all, the images are all yours! Or, at the
    very least, they are all from people you know, increasingly and better.\n\nStay
    in <i><color=#000>The Instagram City</color></i> for as long as you want, and
    freely observe the beautiful and surprising images that appear in the landscape!
    Do you recognize any?\n\n(\u2026 No?)\n\nFinally, just remember not to be surprised
    if your favorite (and favorited) images only last for the brief time of your
    gaze's enthusiasm. In conjunction with expert mathematicians from the University
    of S\xE3o Paulo, the <color=#000>C-GRAM\u2122</color> algorithm was developed
    exclusively for <i><color=#000>The Instagram City</color></i>, and through it
    your favorite images will all be transferred from our programmed, eternal and
    infallible computational memory, instantly to your brain memory, directly to
    your hippocampus, so it can store them forever and ever!\n\nThat is, only if
    you wish.\n\nOr if you make it.\n\nMost sincerely\nand proudly\n\n<color=#000>Geist
    Coorp.\n2021-24\nAll Rights Unreserved</color>"
